        "answerKey": "1. Let the vertex in the first octant be (x, y, z). The volume of the box is V = 8xyz.\n2. Constraint: g(x,y,z) = x^2/a^2 + y^2/b^2 + z^2/c^2 - 1 = 0.\n3. Lagrange equations (grad V = lambda * grad g):\n   8yz = lambda * (2x/a^2)\n   8xz = lambda * (2y/b^2)\n   8xy = lambda * (2z/c^2)\n4. Multiply equations by x, y, and z respectively:\n   8xyz = lambda * (2x^2/a^2)\n   8xyz = lambda * (2y^2/b^2)\n   8xyz = lambda * (2z^2/c^2)\n5. This implies x^2/a^2 = y^2/b^2 = z^2/c^2. Substitute into constraint:\n   3(x^2/a^2) = 1 => x = a/sqrt(3), y = b/sqrt(3), z = c/sqrt(3).\n6. The dimensions of the box are: 2x = 2a/sqrt(3), 2y = 2b/sqrt(3), 2z = 2c/sqrt(3)."
